    "answer": {
      "short": "$k=6$",
      "worked": "For the interval $0\\le t\\le k$, where $k>0$:\n\n$$\\begin{align*}\\frac{V(k)-V(0)}{k-0}&=10\\\\\\frac{k^2+4k+20-20}{k}&=10\\\\k+4&=10\\\\k&=6\\end{align*}$$\n\nThe interval is the first 6 minutes.",
